# =============================================================================
# ai-check-template .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# 方針:
#  - SAGE Development System で本リポを開発しているが、SAGE が install.sh で
#    生成したファイルは local-only として gitignore する
#  - commit 対象は本パッケージ固有のもの: README/LICENSE/CLAUDE.md(マージ済み)
#    /package-templates/, bin/, src/, tests/, docs/(自前) など
#  - Contributors は `bash <(curl ...heidayo/sage-ai-template/install.sh)` を
#    実行して SAGE をローカル導入する（CONTRIBUTING.md で案内予定）
# =============================================================================

# --- SAGE installed: directories (全部 local-only) ---
.sage/
sage/
templates/hooks/
templates/sage/
templates/settings/

# --- SAGE installed: scripts ---
scripts/sage-*.sh

# --- SAGE installed: .claude/ artifacts (SAGE manages, do not commit) ---
.claude/rules/plans-rules.md
.claude/rules/sage-governance-rules.md
.claude/rules/specs-rules.md
.claude/rules/src-rules.md
.claude/rules/tasks-rules.md
.claude/skills/sage-evaluate/
.claude/skills/sage-harness/
.claude/skills/sage-plan/
.claude/skills/sage-promote/
.claude/skills/sage-review/
.claude/skills/sage-spec/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- SAGE installed: docs ---
docs/claude-collaboration-brief.md
docs/codex-delegation-packet.md

# --- SAGE installed: top-level (we don't use Codex; we'll keep merged CLAUDE.md) ---
AGENTS.md

# --- SAGE installed: workflow templates (regeneratable, not part of distribution) ---
specs/_template.md
plans/_template.md
tasks/_template.md

# --- SAGE runtime (already in SAGE's own gitignore semantics) ---
.sage/metrics/
.sage/gist-id
.sage/install-state.yaml
.sage/version
.sage/adoption-audit.md
.sage/backup/
.sage/runtime/
.sage/runs.db
.sage/audit/

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- IDE ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Node.js (for future npm package work) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log

# --- Environment ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
